{"unit_id":"tag:03Y5:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本章介绍代数空间（algebraic spaces）的范畴（category）上的一些拓扑（topologies）。可与 <REF_0001>、<REF_0002>、<REF_0003> 和 <REF_0004> 中的材料比较。在此之前，我们想指出，位点（sites）（定义见《位点（Sites）》定义 <REF_0005>）有许多不同的选择，它们在底层范畴（underlying category）上给出相同的层（sheaf）概念。因此，我们的选择可能与参考文献中的选择略有不同，但最终会得到相同的上同调群（cohomology groups）等。\n\n\n\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"本章研究对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"代数空间组成的范畴；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"范畴上的拓扑；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"不同的位点选择；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点","context":"引用章节名；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴","context":"层所定义于的范畴；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"位点确定的层概念；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群","context":"最终得到的群；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
